1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
Doodle wants a Stockholm's worth of power.
How many jobs does Sweden get?

2
00:00:07,029 --> 00:00:12,507
The deal allows up to 2,000 MW: about as
much as all of Stockholm.

3
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:18,936
The seller says 500 jobs. Doodle: maybe
hundreds, it's still early days.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:25,364
The grid operator warns: unless new power
is built, prices rise nationwide.

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:31,943
Power: one Stockholm. Jobs: too early to
say.
